			<Property name="English" value="" />
			<Property name="French" value="" />
			<Property name="Italian" value="" />
			<Property name="German" value="Suns die and world are made ashen, yet we remain. The ending is no end. Existence is unbounded and languor engulfs the darkness. &#xA;Bring us our meaning, if you are capable." />
